# In a three-player game The Rack chooses Bot3 rather than Bot2, and remains after that chosen player loses (CR 800.4a).
[Life]
Bot3: 2
[Bot1 Deck]
The Rack
Mox Sapphire
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Bot3 Deck]
Mountain
Shock
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Rack.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot3)
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Rack.ChosenPlayer = 3
Bot3.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot3.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot3.Hand.Shock.Cast(Bot3)
[T5 Bot2.Main1]
[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.The Rack.ChosenPlayer = 3
